### Shingle Categories
- 3-Tab: Flat, uniform, cheapest, 20-25 year warranty. Being phased out.
- Architectural (Dimensional): Multi-layered, textured, industry standard. 30yr-Lifetime warranty. Up to 130mph wind resistance. This is what most homeowners get.
- Designer/Luxury: Mimics slate/cedar/tile. Heaviest, most durable. Lifetime warranties.

### Brands We Work With
- IKO (most commonly used): Dynasty (Class 4 hail rating), Nordic (heavy-duty), Cambridge (mid-range), Royal Estate (designer — Chris's favorite in Shadow Slate)
- Michael's favorite: IKO Nordic in Granite Black
