- Owens Corning: Duration series (SureNail technology), Berkshire (premium)
- CertainTeed: Landmark series, Grand Manor (ultra-premium)

### Key Material Knowledge
- Insurance claims cover standard architectural shingles. Homeowner pays upgrade difference for designer.
- Underlayment: Synthetic is modern standard (replaces felt paper). Ice & water shield required in valleys/edges/penetrations.
- Flashing: Metal strips at transitions (walls, chimney, pipes, valleys). Old/bad flashing = #1 cause of leaks.
- Ventilation: Ridge vents (peak) + soffit vents (eave). Inadequate ventilation voids many shingle warranties.
- Metal Roofing: Standing seam (40-70yr, concealed fasteners), Metal shingles, Corrugated/R-Panel. Insurance typically won't cover metal upgrade.

